  "description": "The Flyer is a simple bike. That’s a good thing.\n\nYou won’t find finicky technology that needs constant adjustment, or a saddle position based on aerodynamic studies. Instead, you will find a bike designed to “just go for a ride”. The Flyer will remind you that just balancing on two wheels can feel magical.\n\nWe kept the Flyer user-friendly and ultra-durable. Available in two sizes, the laid back geometry is adaptable to a wide range of riders. Its proven 13t freewheel is built to keep its wheels moving. 2.0” wide Continental tires soak up the bumps and keep the ride comfortable.\n\nAvailable in Black (S/M and M/L) and only in certain countries.",
